Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.19,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\fade(800,600)\shad3\blur1\fs60\c&HF1F1F1&}Episode 7 \N {\fs100} Fairy Tale {おとぎばなしの巻}
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.00,Sign,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.27,0:00:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... Mesmerizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.79,0:00:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What is the tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.39,0:00:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Without tea, it's un{\i1}tea{\i0}nable. {deliberate pun}
Comment: 0,0:00:50.39,0:00:52.71,Note,,0,0,0,,[mucha (literally "tealess") = absurd]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.71,0:00:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,When tea is bitter, it's regret{\i1}tea{\i0}ble. {?? dunno what's that fucha or what the joke is, maybe 苦茶 = kucha?}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.52,0:00:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,When you put tea and tea together, \Nit's a disas{\i1}tea{\i0}r! {idk}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.01,0:01:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... What a pleasant sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.31,0:01:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So good...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.48,0:01:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.41,0:01:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.40,0:01:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This is irresistible!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.27,0:01:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! The ladies love him! \NI'm jealous!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.04,0:01:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Sound is the key to a woman's heart. {lit: women are weak to sounds}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.30,0:01:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.70,0:01:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The sounds of instruments.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.42,0:01:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Music, get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.04,0:01:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, music.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.92,0:01:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So soothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.42,0:01:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Heavenly!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.18,0:01:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.78,0:01:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, even I can conquer {\i1}her{\i0} with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.34,0:01:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{ojamaho doremi reference?!?!?!?}{<- lol}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.24,0:01:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,She's so beautiful I'm always \Ntoo shy to approach her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.66,0:01:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's {\i1}play music{\i0} right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.02,0:02:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Now grow up and become a saxophone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.38,0:02:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.42,0:02:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Bend a little and become a saxophone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.26,0:02:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What a weird rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.36,0:02:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'll be taking them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.25,0:02:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.20,0:02:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Say what you will, the violin is the finest setter of moods.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.75,0:03:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm? Where might I have seen this before?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.74,0:03:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, still not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.91,0:03:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, then let's move on straight to the stereo. {whatever he means by calling an LP stereo}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.25,0:03:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,These are all just junk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.22,0:03:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a music box. {????}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.55,0:03:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just have to rely on her maternal instinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.20,0:04:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone has a mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.42,0:04:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Only I'm alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.42,0:04:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.85,0:04:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you stop crying \Nand tell me the reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.23,0:04:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone has a mate. \NOnly I'm alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.30,0:04:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you put it this way, I understand. \NOkay, leave it to me.{???????}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.16,0:04:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's all create an orchestra.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.42,0:04:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Orchestra?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.54,0:04:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.27,0:04:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, become a stick!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.06,0:04:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a conductor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.34,0:04:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's gather the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.06,0:04:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Those two are going at it! {????}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.07,0:04:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.28,0:04:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart can't resist you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.42,0:04:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Found them!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.42,0:04:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That chest reminds me of drums! {??????}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.58,0:04:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Thought I was kissing a woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.27,0:05:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.29,0:05:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, is everyone ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.96,0:05:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Now gather in front \Nof the Stuck-up Hermit's house! Got it? {tsuntsun = aloof; morose; stuck-up; standoffish; cold; unfriendly - assuming it's that lady}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.33,0:05:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief, don't we need drums?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.75,0:05:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,How about you take care of that yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.42,0:05:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, big stones, small stones, \Nbecome a drum kit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.06,0:06:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that won't do. It had uranium inside. \NI need a thud be a "thud," not an atomic blast! {don = bang, pikadon = atomic bomb}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.73,0:06:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This is ideal!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.05,0:06:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Moon! {??????}{isn't she saying "otsuki-sama"? Like, the Moon}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.77,0:06:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of the question. Forget it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.47,0:06:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Become a small drum.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.43,0:06:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Become a big drum.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.42,0:06:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Become a drumstick and a cymbal! {????}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.23,0:06:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, sorry for the delay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.20,0:07:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No good, it's just laughing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.81,0:07:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.35,0:08:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.66,0:09:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.14,0:09:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.18,0:09:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty good...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.39,0:09:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, everyone, let's try our best one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.86,0:09:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not impressed at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.69,0:09:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's just not to her taste? {appreciation (of art, music, poetry, etc.)}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.88,0:09:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it, you've got me serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.52,0:10:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stand it anymore! \NUgh! So annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.05,0:10:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If you lose your cool, \Nyou're out for the count.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.32,0:10:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Women love the stoic and unperturbed type. {?????}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.64,0:10:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Like this—knock, knock.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.83,0:10:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.00,0:10:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.15,0:10:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, not there! That sound \Nis my weakness, it makes me numb.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.92,0:10:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Then how about this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.70,0:10:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you been doing loitering outside my house all this time? {?????}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.54,0:10:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on in, don't you see it's not locked?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.36,0:11:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sound-sound-sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.99,0:11:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a worthless man, after all...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.56,0:11:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Sound-sound-sound.
